This campaign is suitable only for the experienced commander. The CCA has evolved their technology to an extremely high level, which will require extensive command experience in order to control and appreciate.

MISSION OBJECTIVES:
- Set an Ambush for and destroy the American recycler.
- Destroy the American attack outpost.

ENGINEERING REPORT:
General Karnov has pushed professor Chestikov to speed the production of our new Golem mobile assault turrets. We've dispatched a Golem to aid you in your mission. It is hidden near the American outpost a short distance from the entrance to three passes leading to our main CCA base. Due to the mountainous terrain in this area, the Americans must choose one of these passes in order to launch their assault. As soon as the Americans commit their recycler to one of the passes, order the Golem to nav beacon 3 to cut off any attempt of retreat. Once the Golem is en-route, move your forces to the exit of the pass and destroy the recycler. You must build and deploy Golems to help seal both ends of the canyons in order to ensure the Recycler's destruction.